wnload vortix 0.5.4\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | ARM64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.4/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
